{"id":"javy","name":"Javy","type":"character","aliases":[],"description":"A Wojek investigator who warned Relov while secretly being the one working for Vraska to kill him.","pages":4,"first_seen":"2012-04-09","last_seen":"2012-08-28","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Transguild Promenade","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Transguild_Promenade","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Transguild_Promenade","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Transguild Promenade\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2-e0","era":null,"summary":"Javy leads Relov to a tenement where he sees Zivan's corpse, words carved into every inch of his skin.","participants":["javy","relov","zivan"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","order":354,"story_date":"2012-04-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":8,"quote":"Words had been magically imprinted over every inch of the dead man's body.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=Words%20had%20been%20magically,the%20dead%20man%27s%20body.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-04-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=Words%20had%20been%20magically,the%20dead%20man%27s%20body.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Apr 2012."}},{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2-e1","era":null,"summary":"Javy asks about Zivan; Relov recounts that he was a respected Arbiter who squandered his talent in Rakdos pleasu