ps://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=%22They%27re%20all%20dead%2C%22%20she%20said.%20%22Except%20for%20you.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Apr 2012."}},{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2-e3","era":null,"summary":"Javy explains that someone is slaughtering Azorius in the manner in which they lived their lives, and warns Relov.","participants":["javy","relov"],"location":"transguild-promenade","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","order":354,"story_date":"2012-04-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":36,"quote":"Someone is... slaughtering people in the manner in which they lived their lives,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=Someone%20is...%20slaughtering%20people,they%20lived%20their%20lives%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-04-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=Someone%20is...%20slaughtering%20people,they%20lived%20their%20lives%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Apr 2012."}},{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2-e6","era":null,"summary":"Javy visits Relov's townhouse at midnight and confronts him about signing the order for the Golgari raid.","participants":["javy","relov","golgari-undercity-raid"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","order":354,"story_date":"2012-04-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"\"You ordered it,\" Javy reminded him.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=%22You%20ordered%20it%2C%22%20Javy%20reminded%20him.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-04-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=%22You%20ordered%20it%2C%22%20Javy%20reminded%20him.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Apr 2012."}},{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2-e7","era":null,"summary":"Javy tells Relov she has found a new teacher who holds the truth about life and death, and that those who disturb the cycle must experience a profound death.","participants":["javy","relov"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","order":354,"story_date":"2012-04-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":64,"quote":"I have found a new teacher, and she eclipses my work with the Boros,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=I%20have%20found%20a,work%20with%20the%20Boros%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-04-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=I%20have%20found%20a,work%20with%20the%20Boros%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Apr 2012."}},{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2-e8","era":null,"summary":"Vraska enters, and Javy warns Relov not to look at her face as the gorgon sweeps into the room.","participants":["vraska","javy","relov"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","order":354,"story_date":"2012-04-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":71,"quote":"\"Don't look her in the face,\" Javy ordered Relov as the gorgon swept into the room.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=%22Don%27t%20look%20her%20in,swept%20into%20the%20room.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-04-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=%22Don%27t%20look%20her%20in,swept%20into%20the%20room.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Apr 2012."}},{"id":"the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2-e10","era":null,"summary":"Vraska lets Javy choose Relov's death, and Javy names inaction.","participants":["vraska","javy","relov"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"stories/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","order":354,"story_date":"2012-04-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":79,"quote":"Javy didn't hesitate. \"Inaction,\" she said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=Javy%20didn%27t%20hesitate.%20%22Inaction%2C%22%20she%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Shadows of Prahv, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-04-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-shadows-of-prahv-part-2#:~:text=Javy%20didn%27t%20hesitate.%20%22Inaction%2C%22%20she%20said.